    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>“Everything is a door if you can read the seams.”</em></p><p><strong>The Gate Knows You (1/Short Rest; recharges on Soma Break).</strong> As a reaction, when a creature you can see within 30 feet attempts to open, close, lock, unlock, cross, or pass through a door, gate, threshold, ley-line gate, or named boundary, you impose disadvantage on any check or defense check related to that crossing. The boundary listens to you.</p>",
